|= Status |= Meaning |
|<#D9EAD3> accepted | committed and reviewed foundation |
|<#EADCF8> current | authorized delivery bridge package |
|<#FCE5CD> blocked | terminal blocker owned by another package |
|<#D9EAF7> later | retained North-Star responsibility, not completed here |
